- Make `mc_bfd_set_section_size()` and `mc_bfd_set_section_flags()` dispatch to
  the three-argument or two-argument libbfd API based on that probe.
- Regenerate the stored IHK compatibility patch so the Rocky validation script
  can apply the same fix to a clean IHK submodule.

Justification:
- libbfd changed this API across binutils releases. Rocky 8.10 has the older
  three-argument form while newer development environments can expose the
